{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0242_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0242_1000_p", "source_sha256": "092d794dc0de6d8909224216b2ef3cb85c05783391ed3f83e16fb624184c966a", "ja": "（番組の企画でトレジャーハントに挑戦！　初日の\n洞窟探索は終わったが、明日も別の洞窟に行く予定だ）", "zh": "（节目企划是挑战寻宝！第一天的洞窟探索已经结束了，不过明天还计划去另一座洞窟）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0242_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0242_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "74d3f6517a1ab17a5ea99ef7e06c7d452aab73d61c2663a02d006b458cbcbdaf", "ja": "あ、あの、{$P$}……\nき、今日は、テントで休むんですよね……？", "zh": "那、那个，{$P$}……\n今、今天要在帐篷里休息，对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0242_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0242_1002_p", "source_sha256": "dcb67a771f74bf6afbf8deb6ade80fba0e081fea184d28cbb945b45f05aa66ac", "ja": "一応、その予定になってるよ。\n何か問題でもあったか？", "zh": "目前计划是这样。\n是出什么问题了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0242_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0242_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f1413dea735f99fb9b60c25789a24e656ab84a8ad08d1d7fd4f37eb06d2c0397", "ja": "その……テントって、洞窟みたいな雰囲気があって、\nな、何か、飛び出してきそうな気が……。", "zh": "那个……帐篷给人一种洞窟般的感觉，\n总、总觉得好像会有些什么突然冲出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0242_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0242_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e50910671c56859aa629a8637cfee4e7cece23525e56caf9052f3dbad2190791", "ja": "飛び出す？　ああ、そういえば、今日探検した\n洞窟の天井にも、コウモリがびっしり……", "zh": "飞出来？啊，说起来，今天探险的洞窟天花板上，也密密麻麻地爬满了蝙蝠……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0242_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0242_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7c85167d8699245fb72ae4483774da866a02637893fbe4f966f41880b882e85c", "ja": "い、言わないでください～！\nあの光景を思い出しただけで、鳥肌が……うう～……。", "zh": "别、别说了～！\n光是想起那副景象，我就起鸡皮疙瘩……呜呜……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0242_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0242_1006_p", "source_sha256": "530eaa8dc4b733266dbffc17ce227ecb41a401aa15905e23a989437e930bb8c4", "ja": "ご、ごめん。よっぽど怖かったんだな。\nでも、雪歩が洞窟を怖がるなんてちょっと意外だな。", "zh": "对、对不起。看来你当时真的吓得不轻。\n不过，没想到雪步居然会害怕洞窟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0242_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0242_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "61cd2d2e82cf020e274a940551ad7be30bd4f7e638ab974fb10d16a62664a986", "ja": "そ、そうですか？　私なんて、怖がりで全然ダメダメ\nですよ。今だって、穴掘って埋まりたくて……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗？像我这种胆小鬼，真的完全不行……\n现在也是，好想挖个洞把自己埋进去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0242_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0242_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3eb5b91a3f46b421d1e2158a837bc04b3e00e69d336d620f74589087a3b4370c", "ja": "って、あれ？　もしかして、洞窟って、穴……？\n私が掘らなくても埋まれる、理想の穴なのかも……。", "zh": "咦，等等？难道说，洞窟就是……洞？  \n也许是不用我挖，就能进去躲起来的理想洞穴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0242_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0242_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0eb9860843e41a1dc25cefd4595ac224e92ba1ad1f42b3f3a7cc259ffe724a86", "ja": "そう思ったら、なんだか怖くなくなってきました！\n明日の洞窟探索も、頑張れそうですぅ！　えへへ♪", "zh": "这么一想，好像就没那么害怕了！\n明天的洞窟探险，我也有信心努力了！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
